  },
  "articleBody": "When you're dreaming of a tiny home, knowing your property's potential is step one. A thorough property assessment isn't just a quick glance; it's a deep dive into all the elements that make your land viable for tiny living. Zen Tiny Homes looks at everything from land use planning and zoning restrictions to the topography of your site. We also check out aerial mapping, confirm power and water supply, analyze drainage and septic systems, and even assess what kind of foundation setup will work best. It's like a complete health check for your land, making sure it can support your tiny home dream. This detailed review helps us avoid any surprises during the design and build phases, giving you a clear picture of what's possible and what might need a little extra attention.",
